data: {"id": "429c3e17f9f84648-thinking-parallel_evidence-285", "run_id": "429c3e17f9f84648", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好的，我将开始执行证据采集计划。首先处理已经失败的 Prometheus 查询，并并行执行其他 Kubernetes、Logs、Tracing 和 Topology 查询。\n\n### 第一轮并行采集\n\n**1. 修复 execute_pod_promql (验证容器状态与内存限制)**\n修复参数缺失问题，验证 Pod 当前状态、Last Terminated Reason 和重启计数。\n\n**2. get_pod_spec_and_status**\n获取 Pod YAML，确认内存 limit 和当前状态。\n\n**3. get_pod_events**\n捕获 OOMKilled 或其他终止事件。\n\n**4. analyze_working_set_trend**\n验证内存趋势。\n\n**5. observability-gate-1-logging (已执行，结果已给)**\n日志显示持续 `memory allocation advanced`，`allocated_mib` 持续增加 (38, 40, 42, 44, 46, 48)。\n\n**6. observability-gate-", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788805271576, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

